start language dictionary

type:mapping

*-> ""           - included custom string
    -> exm:type="panasonic ats"

*-> agent      - mapping operator of AI agent
    -> exm:agent("coder")

*-> alias, assoc      - alias or association of any entity
    exm: [xml,doc,dsl] alias file
           open xml

*-> avt          - avatar, identity surface (person/entity)
    -> exm:avt src="photo.png"

*-> bct          - breadcrumb, trail of parent contexts
    -> exm:bct: root:sec:item

*-> bdg          - badge, counters/status dot
    -> exm:bdg count=5

*-> bool          - Y or N - yes, no basic logical boolean
    -> exm:bool:Y

*-> btn          - button action (plain/fab/icon via styp)
    -> exm:btn name="save" act:apr

*-> char          - char
    -> exm:char[n] - char array unknown size

*-> chk, check     - mapping action check/validation
    -> exm: fun "valid user" -> user:chk -> ret

*-> cluster      - mapping cluster of any entity

*-> cnv, convert     - convert, rerole, translate
    -> exm:cnv:xml->class

*-> col          - composition: linear vertical axis of children
    -> exm:col: inp name="login" | btn name="save"

*-> console      - console, or text visual output
    -> exm:con:out:txt="hi"

*-> cos, cosine          - cosine
    -> exm:cos:deg

*-> crd          - card/surface container
    -> exm:crd name="user" thm="elevated"

*-> date          - mapping date

*-> dlg          - dialog, modal/alert
    -> exm:dlg name="confirm"

*-> dvr          - divider, separator line
    -> exm:dvr title="section"

*-> fmt, format  - format/formatter mapping of any entyty
    -> exm: fmt[name,file,date]:table
    -> exm:num:format("0.0")     - float pattern, 0 = digit, 0.0 = 1 decimal, 0.00 = 2 decimals, etc.
    -> exm:num:format("0")       - integer number
    -> exm:num:format("02H")     - hex uppercase, width 2 zero-padded (255 -> FF)
    -> exm:num:format("0.0%")    - percent, 1 decimal (0.5 -> 50.0%)

*-> frm          - composition: frame, bordered/inset container or viewport crop
    -> exm:frm:image name="pic1"

*-> graphics,visual,vis,render, UI - UI user interface mapping comands
    -> exm:graph:scene

*-> grd          - composition: grid, two-axis placement (columns/areas)
    -> exm:grd:cols=3: card name="c1"

*-> grp          - composition: logical cluster of elements, one unit of state
    -> exm:grp name="form": inp | sel

*-> hscroll      - horizontal scroll container, base scroll
    -> exm:hscroll: row: card name="c1"

*-> icn          - icon, pictographic marker
    -> exm:icn name="gear"

*-> in           - input entity or object mapping operator
    -> exm:in:request

*-> inp          - input field (text/number/multiline via styp)
    -> exm:inp name="login" styp:text

*-> io           - End-to-end any entity state modification without change context, mapping command
    -> exm: fun name="mapping" param data, param type io(data->cnv(type))

*-> lang         - mapping any entity language
    -> exm: prj lang="c++"
            user:lang="RU"

*-> lib          - mapping library, codebase, or open source project / git repository, codesnippet
    -> exm:lib:repo="open-utils"

*-> locat, location - logical mapping of location any entity
    -> exm: panel:location=up

*-> lower,lowercase - lowercase any text conversacion or mapping
    -> exm: name=lower("hello")

*-> map, mapping - action mapping for any entity

*-> mapping, map   - action represent entity

*-> mix          - mix action: combine/merge any two objects
    -> exm:mix:->struct
    -> exm:fun open (file name="out.xml" alias xml ): -> open(file name="project.exe"):alias source:->mix(source *? data:type=dom to xml)->save(file:out_1.xml)

*-> msg          - message, output/status message object
    -> exm:show(msg(goal))

*-> nav          - navigation rail/bar/drawer/tab-row, concrete via styp
    -> exm:nav styp:rail: link prj:skl

*-> new          - mapping of creation object
    -> exm:fun name=i new:txt           function inner code create a new txt file

*-> null, void, nil - exact empty value (not a logical operator): explicit void, "nothing here" Unlike none (pure logical absence that continues) null is a concrete empty value: where a value is REQUIRED (req/expected), null HALTS the logic - try/catch, fail; none says "not required/absent, keep going"; null says "empty value present, stop here"
    -> exm:fun name="getarc" if(lng:arc==null)<>:
         -> null
         -> arc
    -> exm:name req -> try name=="null" cch -> halt

*-> num          - unified numeric value for all lang (single representation instead of int, long, float, double): any integer or fractional 32/64 bit number, bit depth and type resolved by value
    -> exm:num:255
    -> exm:num:3.14
    -> exm:num:-42
    -> exm:num:format("0.0") - float format, 0 is a digit placeholder, decimal point sets fraction digits
    -> exm:num:3.14159:format("0.0") - 3.1
    -> exm:num:255:format("02H")     - hex (H), zero-padded width 2: FF
    -> exm:num:255:format("0")       - integer

*-> out          - output mapping of any entity
    -> exm: out:response

*-> ovl          - composition: overlay, layer stacked above the base surface
    -> exm:ovl: dlg name="confirm"

*-> pag          - composition: page, screen/route boundary
    -> exm:pag name="main"

*-> prg          - progress, busy/loading indicator (linear/circular via styp)
    -> exm:prg 45

*-> print         - mapping operator of visual output logic
    -> exm: vis type:table event:onCreate->table:print:data

*-> prompt        - mapping operator of user/human prompt
    -> exm: prompt:run()

*-> proto, protocol - protocol of any entity
    -> exm: prj:"simple http server" lang:java proto:http

*-> protoc, proto - logic mapping protocols
    -> exm:open("connection"):protocol("samba"):\\\\server\share

*-> quote        - mapping of llm text / quote

*-> rcl          - recycler: first-class virtualized list component, not composed from abstracts; manages its own adapter/view-holder pool, view reuse and lazy data binding via src
    -> exm:rcl src="items" item="row"
    -> exm:rcl src="file:list" bind:name/line

*-> ref          - reference mapping of example any entity
    -> exm: file:save(dsl:ref)

*-> reqred, required - required, mapping triger to trigger for mandatory parameter entr, none if absent
    -> exm:type: any reqr

*-> rgx          - regex
    -> exm:rgx:"^[A-Z][a-z]"

*-> row          - composition: linear horizontal axis of children
    -> exm:pan->row: btn name="ok"

*-> sec          - composition: section, block within a page
    -> exm:sec name="profile"

*-> sht          - sheet, bottom/side panel
    -> exm:sht name="filters"

*-> sin, sinus      - sin
    -> exm:sin:rad

*-> skn          - skeleton/shimmer placeholder
    -> exm:skn name="loading_card"

*-> slr          - slider, continuous value input
    -> exm:slr name="volume" def 0..100

*-> sort          - sorted mapping of any entity
    -> exm:list[num]:sort:asc
    -> exm:list[num]:sort:desc

*-> specfile, spec - mapping of specifics and logic
    -> exm: prj "any" stage:1 create spec

*-> spr          - composition: spacer, flexible empty space
    -> exm:row: spr | btn

*-> state        - mapping state of any entity
    -> exm: if(file:state:"opened"):close(file)

*-> string       - string (var or literal str:"..."; structure is struct, never str)
    -> exm:str:"value"

*-> struct       - any predefined structure or class in the case of OOP
    -> exm:struct:->box

*-> svc, service   - mapping service role of entity
    -> exm: thread svc:"micro_transaction"

*-> tab, table          - table, table mapping of any entity instruction
    -> exm: show(file:"dictionery.txt" to tab:rows["names"])

*-> text         - visual text
    -> exm:text:label

*-> tgl          - binary toggle control
    -> exm:tgl name="dark_mode" def:dwn

*-> think        - mapping operator of model reflections.
    -> exm:think:->show

*-> time          - mapping time

*-> tip          - tooltip, hover help
    -> exm:tip txt="click to save"

*-> to           - logical pointer from entity to entity read from left to right: maps to the target entity
    -> exm: string to array
    -> exm: file to string
    -> exm: data:"json" convert to data:"xml"

*-> token          - llm token object mapping 
    -> exm: save(llm:token)    example save gurent session

*-> true, Y, yes, false, N, no - boolean literals: synonyms of the bool values Y / N
    -> exm:alw:true
    -> exm:def:false

*-> type          - mapping type of any entity
    -> exm: Convert("HelloWorld" lang="ru" type="colloquial")->show()

*-> UI,vis          - visual element or type
    -> exm:UI:pan

*-> uper,upercase   - upercase any text conversation or mapping
    -> exm: name=uper("HEllO") 
    -> exm: name="Hello world":uper

*-> view         - concrete view frame: a definite rendered frame/screen instance (not vis - vis is the visual element/type abstraction)
    -> exm:view name="main" src="layout.xml"

*-> vscroll      - vertical scroll container, base scroll
    -> exm:vscroll: list name="items"

*-> with         - mapping of logic extension
